(property "Description" "USB-C receptacle, USB 2.0: 16 contacts on the 12 composite GCT solder lands (shared A1/B12, A4/B9, B4/A9, B1/A12; single A5, A6, A7, A8, B5, B6, B7, B8) plus the plated shell stakes S1–S4; the provisional footprint uses the 16 JLCPCB pad IDs (each shared land is two touching pads on one net), plus two Ø0.65 mm non-plated locating holes; pin-in-paste on S1–S4 only after JLCPCB confirms the process and the aperture geometry (G-6); fallback: the owner hand-solders S1–S4 from the bottom side before the first plug-in (the stakes carry the shell and the mechanical retention); shell to GND via R107" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
